stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Assigned : System matches Available volunteer
    Assigned --> Acknowledged : evt_task_acknowledged [Volunteer client]
    Acknowledged --> InProgress : evt_task_started [Volunteer transit starts]
    
    InProgress --> Completed : evt_task_completed [Location verification]
    InProgress --> Failed : evt_task_failed [Blocked / Override]
    Assigned --> Failed : Acknowledgment Timeout (3 min)
